    "notes": "Examples of all the symbols available in the \"KBD webfont\" provided by KLE.\n\nFor example, to use the icon with the name \"logo-linux-tux\", write this as a legend:\n<i class='kb kb-logo-linux-tux'></i>\n\nAdditional text can be placed before or after to also have a textual lengend next to the icon.\nThe icons tend to be small.  Adding \"kb-lg\" to the list of classes will make them a little bigger.",
